.TH OMACAL 1 "August 2026" "omacal 0.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
omacal \- Omarchy-native CalDAV calendar
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B omacal
.RI [ options "] [" file.ics "]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B omacal
is a fast, local-first desktop calendar for Omarchy / Arch / Hyprland.
It syncs natively with Nextcloud CalDAV (not vdirsyncer), stores events
local-first in SQLite, keeps passwords in the system keyring, and reloads
the active Omarchy theme live.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help (Tauri window).
.TP
.BR file.ics
Open an \fI.ics\fR file in Omacal (also via \fBtext/calendar\fR MIME handler).
Imports are previewed; picking a calendar and saving creates a new event.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/omacal/config.toml
Accounts and locale (URLs, usernames, addresses; never passwords).
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/omacal/omacal.db
SQLite store (calendars, objects, alarm_log, meta).
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/omarchy/current/theme/colors.toml
Active Omarchy theme (fallback \fI~/.config/omarchy/current/theme/colors.toml\fR).
.TP
.I ~/.config/hypr/omacal.conf
Optional Hyprland floating rule; or \fIpackaging/hypr/omacal.lua\fR via \fIlooknfeel.lua\fR.
.TP
.I ~/.config/systemd/user/omacal.service
User daemon (also aliased \fIomacal-daemon.service\fR).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B OMACAL_START_HIDDEN=1
Start with the window hidden (tray/daemon mode).
.TP
.B RUST_LOG
Log level (\fIinfo\fR recommended for the daemon).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hyprland (1),
.BR systemctl (1),
.BR omarchy-omacal (1),
.BR omacal-waybar (1)
